1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,717
Before you press the final button,
confirm the company, security,

2
00:00:04,717 --> 00:00:07,113
amount, fees, and payment
method.

3
00:00:07,112 --> 00:00:11,498
In a Reg CF offering, submitting
an investment generally creates a

4
00:00:11,498 --> 00:00:13,425
commitment, but federal rules

5
00:00:13,425 --> 00:00:15,950
provide a limited cancellation
window.

6
00:00:15,950 --> 00:00:17,788
You may cancel for any reason

7
00:00:17,788 --> 00:00:21,275
until forty-eight hours before the
offering’s deadline.

8
00:00:21,275 --> 00:00:25,490
During the final forty-eight hours,
you generally cannot cancel for

9
00:00:25,490 --> 00:00:28,825
any reason, even if you
committed within that period.

10
00:00:28,825 --> 00:00:33,092
If the company makes a material
change to the offering, investors

11
00:00:33,092 --> 00:00:36,112
must be given five business days
to reconfirm.

12
00:00:36,112 --> 00:00:39,977
The exact platform steps and
notices matter, so read the

13
00:00:39,977 --> 00:00:42,600
confirmation and official
disclosures.

14
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:44,712
These rules apply to Reg CF and

15
00:00:44,712 --> 00:00:48,188
