private investment.

16
00:00:48,188 --> 00:00:51,950
A commitment is not a casual
“save for later” click.

17
00:00:51,950 --> 00:00:55,864
If you are uncertain, review the
terms before committing rather

18
00:00:55,864 --> 00:00:58,162
than relying on a later
cancellation.

19
00:00:58,162 --> 00:01:00,419
Keep a copy of the confirmation

20
00:01:00,419 --> 00:01:03,768
